Interpretation
--------------
The full-50 joint model's earlier prefix points are retrospective and use
future-task training examples. The stage-matched curve does not. Their mean
difference is +3.164 percentage points across 50 stages and +3.229 points over
stages 1--49. At task 50 the curves are the same authenticated model, yet it
still exceeds the true-node oracle by 2.133 points. Missing future information
therefore contributes before the endpoint but cannot explain the endpoint
node-quality gap.
